            "pages": {
              "end": 5,
              "start": 5
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioner, the case arose over whether the CRSC statute grants the secretary of a military department authority to settle claims, which would make the Barring Act inapplicable."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "5562cf6cd09385c8179644f828094b21cf14dc1ee9ff727ba7615e3bc90b02d5",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-5562cf6cd093-0000-0009"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 5,
              "start": 5
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The petitioner argues that subsection (d) of the CRSC statute authorizes the secretary to consider eligibility and to determine the validity of a claim."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "5562cf6cd09385c8179644f828094b21cf14dc1ee9ff727ba7615e3bc90b02d5",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-5562cf6cd093-0000-0015"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 18,
              "start": 18
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The petitioner says the waiver provision does not come into play."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Government",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "5562cf6cd09385c8179644f828094b21cf14dc1ee9ff727ba7615e3bc90b02d5",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-5562cf6cd093-0000-0011"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 9,
              "start": 9
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The government argues that other statutes are not part of this case because reading Section\u202f1413a literally could destabilize military pay."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Government",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "5562cf6cd09385c8179644f828094b21cf14dc1ee9ff727ba7615e3bc90b02d5",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-5562cf6cd093-0003-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 72,
              "start": 72
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The government contends that a statute that authorizes an official to determine the validity and amount due on claims is a settlement authority."
      }
    ],
